      "updated": 1784395530398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uber\nRide sharing platform, allows user to book rides on-demand matching them with nearby drivers.\n\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Riders request estimated fare\n- Riders accept fare to get matched with a driver\n- Driver can accept/deny and navigate to pickup/dropoff\n\n---------- Out of Scope ----------\n- Rating drivers/riders\n- Scheduling rides in advance\n- Support different ride types (X, XL etc.)\n\n\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Low latency ride matching (< 1 minute)\n- Strong consistency for matching\n- Handle surges (100k from same location at same time)\n\n\n------------ Out of Scope ------------\n- GDPR(Data protection as per European Standards)\n- Backups\n- CI/CD\n- Falut Tolerance\n- Monitoring",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uber\nRide sharing platform, allows user to book rides on-demand matching them with nearby drivers.\n\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Riders request estimated fare\n- Riders accept fare to get matched with a driver\n- Driver can accept/deny and navigate to pickup/dropoff\n\n---------- Out of Scope ----------\n- Rating drivers/riders\n- Scheduling rides in advance\n- Support different ride types (X, XL etc.)\n\n\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Low latency ride matching (< 1 minute)\n- Strong consistency for matching\n- Handle surges (100k from same location at same time)\n\n\n------------ Out of Scope ------------\n- GDPR(Data protection as per European Standards)\n- Backups\n- CI/CD\n- Falut Tolerance\n- Monitoring",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZX3vPhRLDLzp54RAtVego",
